note SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR GPL-2.0-only
note abi: check an ioctl argument block of /dev/aien-gpu before the kernel acts on it.
note The kernel copies the user's block (128 bytes, little endian, layout in kmod/aien_gpu_uapi.h) into
note kernel memory first, so the block cannot change between this check and its use.
note req 1 = AGPU_BOOT. Fields: 0 version (2 = AGPU_BOOT_VERSION, the GB20B agpu_boot_out; 1 was the GB10B
note layout and is refused), 8 cotoff (arena offset of the SEC2 COT packet, 4-aligned),
note 16 cotlen (1..1024), 20 appver, 24 fmcpa (device address of GSP_FMC_BOOT_PARAMS, 88 bytes, inside the
note arena), 32 cmdqoff and 40 statqoff (arena offsets of the two 262144-byte queues, 4096-aligned,
note disjoint), 48..63 four poll budgets (each 1..10000000), 64 pause_us (1..1000), 68 waitms
note (1..60000), 72 txseq (the command-queue sequence number the package left), 76..127 zero.
note Result 0 accept, or a refusal code: 1 unknown request, 2 version, 3 COT packet, 4 FMC arguments
note outside the arena, 5 queue offsets, 6 poll budget, 7 pause, 8 wait, 9 reserved bytes not zero.
note req 2 = AGPU_ARENA_READ: 0 off, 8 len (1..16777216), 16 user pointer (not checked here; the kernel
note copies with copy_to_user). Refusal 10: the range is empty, too long or not inside the arena.
fn ld32 a view uchar 128 o ulong to ulong
x = or ulong get a o shl ulong get a add o 1 8
y = or shl ulong get a add o 2 16 shl ulong get a add o 3 24
ret or x y
end
fn ld64 a view uchar 128 o ulong to ulong
ret or ld32 a o shl ld32 a add o 4 32
end
note an arena range [off, off+n) is inside the arena without wrapping
fn inside off ulong n ulong abytes ulong to bool
if gt n abytes
ret false
end
ret le off sub abytes n
end
fn qok a view uchar 128 abytes ulong to bool
c = ld64 a 32
s = ld64 a 40
if or ne and c 4095 0 ne and s 4095 0
ret false
end
if or not inside c 262144 abytes not inside s 262144 abytes
ret false
end
if lt c s
ret le add c 262144 s
end
ret le add s 262144 c
end
fn bootchk a view uchar 128 aiova ulong abytes ulong to ulong
if ne ld32 a 0 2
ret 2
end
co = ld64 a 8
cl = ld32 a 16
if or or eq cl 0 gt cl 1024 ne and co 3 0
ret 3
end
if not inside co cl abytes
ret 3
end
f = ld64 a 24
if or lt f aiova not inside sub f aiova 88 abytes
ret 4
end
if not qok a abytes
ret 5
end
for k ulong 4
p = ld32 a add 48 mul k 4
if or eq p 0 gt p 10000000
ret 6
end
end
p = ld32 a 64
if or eq p 0 gt p 1000
ret 7
end
p = ld32 a 68
if or eq p 0 gt p 60000
ret 8
end
for k ulong 52
if ne get a add 76 k 0
ret 9
end
end
ret 0
end
fn agpu_abi_check req ulong a view uchar 128 aiova ulong abytes ulong to ulong
if eq req 1
ret bootchk a aiova abytes
end
if eq req 2
n = ld64 a 8
if or or eq n 0 gt n 16777216 not inside ld64 a 0 n abytes
ret 10
end
ret 0
end
ret 1
end
